    goal: "travel", tier: "fundamental", section: "9011",
    title: "Travel as a Couple's Self-Expansion — Do the Exciting Thing, Not the Pleasant Thing",
    subtitle: "Shared novel and arousing activities raise relationship quality; merely pleasant shared time does not",
