    id: "gs-travel-fear-of-flying",
    goal: "travel", tier: "advanced", section: "9015",
    title: "Treat the Fear of Flying — Exposure Works, Virtual or Real, in About Eight Sessions",
    subtitle: "Randomized trials: 76–93% of treated patients fly after treatment, gains hold at 1–2 years, and VR is as good as an actual airplane",
